Support SMTPUTF8 mailbox addresses consistently across the admin UI, API, models, and Postfix lookups while enforcing IDNA and UTF-8 octet limits.
Advertise SMTPUTF8 on port 25 and enable end-to-end delivery through Dovecot LMTP.
Fix authentication for mailbox names containing non-ASCII characters.
Return a not-found response for malformed Postfix lookup keys instead of causing temporary mail failures.
Stop Dovecot submission ports from advertising the unsupported BURL capability.
